  "prefLabel": "Ins 3507.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ins 3507.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to recognize, permit, and prescribe the use of the 2001 Commissioners' Standard Ordinary (CSO) Mortality Table in accordance with RSA 410:3, I, RSA 409:5-b, VIII(f), Ins 3504.01, and Ins 3504.02.\n\nSource. #8144, eff 9-1-04; ss by #10194, eff 10-1-12; ss by #13471, eff 10-24-22",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/ins3500.html"
